  "description": "The Syncfusion® .NET WPF SfToastNotification control provides an elegant way to display both Windows toast notifications and in-app toast messages within your application. It offers rich customization options including message types, icons, animations, durations, placements and interaction behaviors. Whether used for status updates, warnings, reminders, or user actions, the ToastNotification control delivers clear, timely, and modern user alerts.",
